                                "example_id": "cf6d031c-31a7-400a-9994-71422e072134",
                                "sense_id": "9cc56d97-d3e0-3d2a-8ef8-9ef513a91dd3",
                                "text": "Some commenters foresaw the possibility that \"a handful of very compensated employees could tilt the average high enough to meet the minimum average benefit with little or no contributions to the 'average' employee ."
